stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> WARMING: deploy or startup

    state "WARMING" as WARMING
    state "READY" as READY
    state "CLAIMED" as CLAIMED
    state "RUNNING" as RUNNING
    state "CLEANING" as CLEANING
    WARMING --> READY: all warm proofs fresh
    READY --> CLAIMED: O(1) fenced claim
    CLAIMED --> RUNNING: bell accepted
    RUNNING --> CLEANING: result, failure, or towel
    CLEANING --> WARMING: cleanup exact, enqueue N+1

    note right of WARMING
      Automatic backstage work.
      May take about 3,600 seconds.
      Retries never run in a user request.
    end note

    note right of READY
      Both targets and runners are prepared.
      The per-bout RDS Proxy is absent.
      Lost freshness returns to WARMING.
    end note
